    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://cropontology.org/rdf/Computation"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Calculate mean of stem girth at 20cm above ground</rdfs:label>
    <ns1:definition xml:lang="en">Measure the girth or circumference of the stem at 20cm above the ground level using using a measuring tape (tape strapped around the stem), calculate mean from 30 randomly selected palms.
</ns1:definition>
