  <ns2:Class rdf:about="https://cropontology.org/rdf/CO_326:0000299">
    <ns1:definition xml:lang="en">During FCA: dehusk 3 fruits and weigh nuts together. Divide total weight by the number of fruits. Perform 6 times a year during four consecutive years and record mean. Calculate standard deviation over 30 palms.</ns1:definition>
